flowchart TB
  IN1[/Input: browser HTTP request URL, cookies/]
  IN2[/Input: form POST, uploads, API JSON body/]

  P1[Process: Apache runs PHP entry script]

  D1{Decision: route is public marketing or auth page?}

  P2[Process: render public PHP HTML]
  OUT1[/Output: HTML, CSS, JS, static assets/]

  P3[Process: load session and DB config]
  D2{Decision: user authenticated and session not timed out?}

  P4[Process: redirect to login with message]
  OUT2[/Output: HTML login or signup page/]

  P5[Process: apply layout shell load app page logic]
  D3{Decision: needs JSON data from api layer?}

  P6[Process: query and mutate via mysqli repositories]
  P7[Process: build JSON from api scripts]

  D4{Decision: response type}

  P8[Process: render full HTML page]
  P9[Process: render or stream PDF export]
  P10[Process: write read files in uploads]

  OUT3[/Output: HTML app page/]
  OUT4[/Output: JSON for charts tables forms/]
  OUT5[/Output: PDF file download/]
  OUT6[/Output: stored files and download links/]

  C1((1))

  OF1((A))
  OF2((B))

  IN1 --> P1
  IN2 --> P1
  P1 --> D1

  D1 -->|Yes| P2
  P2 --> OUT1

  D1 -->|No| P3
  P3 --> D2
  D2 -->|No| P4
  P4 --> OUT2

  D2 -->|Yes| P5
  P5 --> D3
  D3 -->|No| C1
  D3 -->|Yes| P6
  P6 --> P7
  P7 --> C1
  C1 --> D4

  D4 -->|HTML| P8
  D4 -->|JSON| P8
  D4 -->|PDF| P9
  D4 -->|Files| P10

  P8 --> OUT3
  P8 --> OUT4
  P9 --> OUT5
  P10 --> OUT6

  P6 --> OF1
  P9 --> OF2
